:"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LeftComputable}\">\\(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_S\">\\(\\le_S\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a566c9610179ba40\" href=\"?note=a566c9610179ba40\" title=\"43-df-solovay-red\">43-df-solovay-red</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma,\\delta\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma,\\delta\\)</span> 均量化于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R\">\\(\\mathbb R\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\left(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\beta)\\land\\neg\\exists\\gamma\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\left(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\gamma)\\land\\gamma\\le_S\\alpha\\land\\gamma\\le_S\\beta\\land\\forall\\delta\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\left(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\delta)\\land\\delta\\le_S\\alpha\\land\\delta\\le_S\\beta\\implies\\delta\\le_S\\gamma\\right)\\right)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\left(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\beta)\\land\\neg\\exists\\gamma\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\left(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\gamma)\\land\\gamma\\le_S\\alpha\\land\\gamma\\le_S\\beta\\land\\forall\\delta\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\left(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\delta)\\land\\delta\\le_S\\alpha\\land\\delta\\le_S\\beta\\implies\\delta\\le_S\\gamma\\right)\\right)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书给出更强的见证：可取来自 c.e. 集的相应实数。本节只保留证明“左 c.e. Solovay 度不是格”所需的精确最小核，即某对度不存在最大公共下界；不把未定义的“infimum”谓词当成形式断言。来源证明为有限损伤构造，本轮仅核对陈述和见证类型。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 2007-07-28 草稿，Theorem 13.4.3, left-c.e. consequence；印刷页 346–347，PDF 页 366–367。本轮核对范围及证明限制如上。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-solovay-red","status":"resolved","id":"a566c9610179ba40","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-solovay-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-solovay-red","status":"resolved","id":"a566c9610179ba40","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LeftComputable}$ 与 $\\le_S$ 采用 [[43-df-solovay-red]]；$\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma,\\delta$ 均量化于 $\\mathbb R$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{LeftComputable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma,\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\left(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\beta)\\land\\neg\\exists\\gamma\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\left(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\gamma)\\land\\gamma\\le_S\\alpha\\land\\gamma\\le_S\\beta\\land\\forall\\delta\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\left(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\delta)\\land\\delta\\le_S\\alpha\\land\\delta\\le_S\\beta\\implies\\delta\\le_S\\gamma\\right)\\right)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1800,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-325","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-solovay-no-infimum]] — A Pair of Solovay Degrees without an Infimum"}],"outgoing":["a566c9610179ba40"]}